    "title": "Chicago Walnut Room offers early holiday reservations to celebrate anniversary - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By ABC7 Chicago Digital Team ,\n7 hours ago\nEarly reservations are available for a local holiday favorite with one simple catch.\nMacy's Walnut Room on State Street is offering early access to holiday reservations exclusively to guests who dine in at the restaurant Wednesday through Sept. 23.\nABC7 Chicago is now streaming 24/7. Click here to watch This offer comes as a part of the restaurant's 118-year anniversary celebration, which also includes a limited-time menu available until Sept. 23\nGuests that dine in at the restaurant during this window will be given first access to make early holiday reservations directly with the restaurant host after finishing their meal.\nFor those not able to make it to the Walnut Room early, regular holiday reservations will open to the public Sept. 25.\n1",
